{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/extras/6373156dc2e06e274c06e8a5e9df7581.poster.avif?t=1764945807\" width=500 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/extras/6373156dc2e06e274c06e8a5e9df7581.webm?t=1764945807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/extras/6373156dc2e06e274c06e8a5e9df7581.mp4?t=1764945807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mazewar</strong> is a remake inspired by the first-ever multiplayer first-person shooter, dating back to 1973. Modernized and subtly enhanced with new mechanics, this recreation keeps the original spirit alive and pulls this forgotten shooter into the present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through mazes, battling enemy eyes, compete against friends on servers in this grid-based, vector-graphics shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New features that set this version apart from the classic include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to dodge enemy fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Themes to customize your visual experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive, fast-paced, and strategic gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Quick Join:</strong><br>Automatically searches for an active online match and connects you instantly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Start Online Match:</strong><br>Creates a new online match that any player can join. You can also invite friends directly through the Steam chat or your friends list.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Start Offline Match:</strong><br>Starts an offline session designed exclusively for playing against bots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Play Note:</strong><br>Mazewar uses <strong>P2P networking</strong>, so latency will depend on the distance between players and the quality of their connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W - SPACE\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 -&gt; Missile launcher</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 -&gt; Laser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A - D\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 -&gt; Dodge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 -&gt; Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 -&gt; Players List</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Square/X \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 -&gt; Missile launcher</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R1/RB \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 -&gt; Laser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LT/L2 - RT/R2 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 -&gt; Dodge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Right D-pad\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 -&gt; Rotate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X/A - Up\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 -&gt; Move Forwards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circle/B\u00a0 - Down\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 -&gt; Move Backwards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SELECT \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 -&gt; Players List</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: </strong>The project is still in much needed development, but you can already dive in and get a glimpse of this piece of gaming history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3298130?t=1764945807","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764945807","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/eb524a36fcb9c4fe37036a596e7759f282d5250d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764945807","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/eb524a36fcb9c4fe37036a596e7759f282d5250d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764945807","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/extras/6373156dc2e06e274c06e8a5e9df7581.poster.avif?t=1764945807\" width=500 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/extras/6373156dc2e06e274c06e8a5e9df7581.webm?t=1764945807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/extras/6373156dc2e06e274c06e8a5e9df7581.mp4?t=1764945807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragra